      <description align="center" color="red" colored="true" height="674" resized="true" width="357" x="10" y="10">Prepare Optimizer Variables&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;Naveen Kumar&lt;br&gt;Karthik Sanagapalli&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;This process extracts variable tags from the variable table and evaluates expressions using ccp_info_id to compute their bounds and initial values. These are combined with attributes like last_good_value and mean_of_bound to form the variable_initial_value dataset for the Gekko optimizer. It also ensures all derived expression tags, except parameters, are included as variables or parameters for consistency.&lt;br&gt;Inputs:&lt;br&gt;1: actual data&lt;br&gt;2:variables&lt;br&gt;3: Derived equations&lt;br&gt;4: model_tag&lt;br&gt;5:model_status&lt;br&gt;6:Switch configuration&lt;br&gt;7:last optimum&lt;br&gt;8: last good value&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Output:&lt;br&gt;1. Variables&lt;br&gt;2. Variable initial value&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <description align="center" color="green" colored="true" height="672" resized="true" width="297" x="378" y="11">Initialization</description>
      <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="174" resized="false" width="180" x="452" y="332">I/P 1: actual data&lt;br&gt;I/P 2:variables&lt;br&gt;I/P 3: Derived equations&lt;br&gt;I/P 4: model_tag&lt;br&gt;I/P 5:model_status&lt;br&gt;I/P 6:Switch configuration&lt;br&gt;I/P 7:last optimum&lt;br&gt;I/P 8: last good value&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <description align="center" color="blue" colored="true" height="677" resized="true" width="258" x="689" y="12">Main</description>
    </process>
